id: attendants-focus-fourth-effect
name: Attendant's Focus
type: standard
actionCost: 1
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/encounter
fromTrait: attendants-focus
fromEffect: 4
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Attendant's Focus's fourth effect, as a Maneuver: Counter Actions spent, as many Allies in your Guidance Range a Healing Surge.
text: >
  (4)-[1/Encounter]: As a Standard Maneuver with an Action Cost of 1 Action, you may spend any number of Counter Actions. Then, for each Action spent, you may target an Ally within your Guidance Range. Those targeted Allies may use a Healing Surge as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.

---

# How many Counter Actions, and which Allies in range - one each - asked before anything is paid (use-maneuver.mjs); on its card,
# a Healing Surge out of sequence offered to each (chat.mjs takeHealingSurge).
